Third-party notice

aria2 (https://github.com/aria2/aria2) is licensed under GPLv2. It is NOT
included in this repository. Siphon launches an external `aria2c` executable
over JSON-RPC and does not link libaria2 or combine binaries. The build script
copies a locally installed aria2c into the .app bundle; anyone redistributing
that bundle must comply with aria2's GPLv2 (provide the corresponding source,
or ship an unmodified binary obtained from its upstream distribution).

ffmpeg, when bundled, is licensed under LGPL/GPL depending on its build
configuration. It is optional and likewise not included here.
